Source: hako-siv3d-games
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: hako-os <hako@hako-os>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3:native, cmake, git
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: hako-siv3d-games
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 libegl1, libgles2, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1,
 libxkbcommon0, libdrm2, libgbm1
Description: Siv3D game collection for hako (the game samples of Siv3D)
 The game samples of the Siv3D documentation (https://siv3d.github.io/ja-jp/samples/games/),
 22 of them, in one app with a menu, playable with the built-in pad of a handheld
 and with touch. Built with the SDL3 port of OpenSiv3D; the program, its SDL3 and
 the Siv3D engine resources are in /usr/lib/hako/siv3d-games. The licenses are
 shown from the menu. Registered in hako-launcher as "Siv3D ゲーム集".
